  "description": "An alternative to Microsoft.AspNetCore.ResponseCaching, which supports IDistributedCache, allows custom reponse caches, and provides a modifiable distributed response cache, which uses an injecting distributed cache, and options which allow clearing or ignoring the cache.\nIt uses Microsoft.AspNetCore.ResponseCaching internally (via git submodule and linking in csproj)",
